<title>POLAND: ARIEL SEES 1997 NET UP TO PLN 2.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>ARIEL SEES 1997 NET UP TO PLN 2.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish shoe firm Ariel SA said in a Wednesday statement it expected its net profit to rise to 2.6 million zlotys and sales to grow to 24.8 million in 1997.</p>
<p>Last year Ariel netted 1.88 million zlotys on sales worth 15.02 million zlotys.</p>
<p>It also said that its pre-tax should rise to 4.2 million zlotys this year from 3.15 million in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
